生举报3岁男童疑遭生父长期虐待，当地：其父已被采取强制措施"},"attached_info":"CkoI6cb/h/mzjOVLEAMaCTExNDY1Nzg1NCCV6KbABjAAOJACQBByEzE4OTg3MDQzMzQzMTg5NTM0MzJ4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"57 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-8a5c3298b0cca407175d30741b25970a_1440w.webp?source=1def8aca"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"17_1745548512.903786","card_id":"Q_660699488","target":{"id":660699488,"title":"铁路线上的终点站一定是大站，对吗？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/660699488","type":"question","created":1720063984,"answer_count":30,"follower_count":59,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[2883,22660,63294],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"Cj8I6cb/h/mzjOVLEAMaCTEwOTA5OTY3NCDwr5i0BjAAODtAEXIJNjYwNjk5NDg4eACqAQliaWxsYm9hcmTSAQA=","detail_text":"54 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d3ddea2f26f9c2d0bbaa8d2d74295eaf_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"18_1745548512.904115","card_id":"Q_650118780","target":{"id":650118780,"title":"你认为央视春晚历史上的最佳小品是哪个？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/650118780","type":"question","created":1711364238,"answer_count":198,"follower_count":499,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[3931,5326,19801,89136,3385434],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkAI6cb/h/mzjOVLEAMaCTEwNjc0ODY4MiCOsYWwBjAAOPMDQBJyCTY1MDExODc4MHgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"54 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-093653b216ae95ff6d513e99674b427e_1440w.webp?source=1def8aca"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1",